data-disabled`"],[1225,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1314,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[282,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1816,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1748,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1260,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[761,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[417,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1541,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[902,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1263,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1656,"**Space / Enter**"],[1103,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[281,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[809,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1228,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[651,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[661,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1322,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[901,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1790,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1779,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[601,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[645,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1652,"**Tab**"],[280,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1100,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1226,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1592,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1590,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1591,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1055,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1648,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1647,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1794,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[17